# OpenToolbars commands for PowerPoint, from claude_ClassicToolbar_PowerPoint_Commands_rev02_2026-10-24.md, in table order.
# The build compresses this file into the DLL. Format: "menu <id> <caption number> <fallback caption>" starts
# a menu, with 0 meaning no caption number. "Parent|Command" puts a command in a submenu named Parent.
# "standard", "formatting", "drawing1" and "drawing2" start the rows. Every other line is one Office
# command name (idMso).

